  "description": "Sung Hye-Min, a senior associate at B-SAM (Bureau of Supernatural Ability Management), is on the verge of completing his final task for promotion when he’s suddenly assigned a rookie, Lee Jee-Yoon.\n\n*\"I pulled a few strings to get in here so I could see you.\"*\n\n*\"...You pulled strings to land this job? Why?!\"*\n\nWith his long-awaited promotion at stake, Hye-Min must navigate the chaos of mentoring this unexpected rookie from the above...!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Part of Blühen's Hageukasang (하극상) Short Story Collection or Downfall Collection in English.*",
